{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "John in Belize", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "It Was Awesome!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Between the Market Stalls > Guatemala Crafts", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Present Simple vs. Present Continuous", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Present tense to talk about a routine or a specific action that happens regularly. You use the Simple Present to describe a scene, or give personal information. You can use expressions of frequency like <span class=\"italic\">every day </span> or <span class=\"italic\">always </span> with the Simple Present.<br><br>You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about a current event or action happening right now. You can also use the Present Continuous to talk about events that <span class=\"strong\">are happening</span> soon.  You make the Present Continuous with the verb <span class=\"strong\"> to be + -ing</span>. You can use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">right now</span> or <span class=\"italic\">later </span>with the Present Continuous.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Simple\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The race commemorates the Maya tradition.<br><br>  I stay at home on weekends.  <br><br>I take the bus to work every morning.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The Indigenous people are commemorating their heritage today.<br> <br>I'm staying here one more night.<br> <br>We're taking the bus back to Belize City tomorrow morning.<br><br></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished event or a specific time in the past.<br>  <br>You can form the regular form of the Simple Past tense by adding <span class=\"strong\">ed</span> to the verb.<br>  <br>Some verbs are irregular. Their Past Simple form doesn't end in -ed or -ied, like <span class=\"italic\">came</span> or <span class=\"italic\">was</span>  or <span class=\"italic\">won</span>.<br>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Tense with <span class=\\\"italic\\\">-ed</span> ending\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"capsize \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"capsized\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"happen \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"happened\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"commemorate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"commemorated \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"finish\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"finished\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "&nbsp;", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Tense with irregular ending\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"come\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"came\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lost\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"went\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"get\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"take\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"took\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "consolation prize ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a reward for the losing team ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We received the consolation prize!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a conversation about a boat race.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "competition ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a race with a winner and a loser ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Belize River Challenge is a tough competition!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "competitive ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "enjoying competition ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't like losing. I am very competitive!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to capsize ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to flip a canoe or boat upside down ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our boat capsized a few times.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "epic ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very exciting (informal) ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The competition was epic!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to commemorate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to celebrate; to honor ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The race commemorates the Maya tradition.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "civilization", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the culture and history of a group of people ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Maya civilization was fascinating.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and research a past civilization.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph (5-8 lines).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe the people of that civilization.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 3 main events that happened during that period.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your paragraph with your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I research a past civilization.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe people and events from a past culture.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph about events in the past.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn4le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So how did it go, John? Did you win?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Are you kidding? We came in last!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What happened?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Well, our boat capsized a few times. Then we lost a few paddles. It was epic!"}, {"image": "engenn4le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "16000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What did you do? You are usually very competitive.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: We just went along for the experience! That's what this competition was all about!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You sound happy. That's good!"}, {"image": "engenn4le09ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "29000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yes. It was awesome. We got the consolation prize!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What was it?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Local handicrafts. They commemorate the Maya and their fascinating civilization."}, {"image": "engenn4le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "40500", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Amazing. You must be tired!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: A little. It took four days to get to the finish line.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So what happens now?"}, {"image": "engenn4le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "50000", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: We are staying here for one more night. Then we're taking the bus back to Belize City tomorrow.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Talk soon! I'm going to a meeting now!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le09ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le09ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}], "audiosrc": "", "coverimg": ""}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about celebrations and customs. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask and talk about what people do and what people are doing.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can report about things, actions, events, or people.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"con